WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:39.050
The purpose of this first drop operation

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:42.810
is the eradication of the large Blue Nest centered in Tanzania,

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:46.450
on the African continent.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.720
Naturally, it is predicted that the Blue counterattack

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:51.560
will be larger than ever before.

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:56.120
However, we must battle on!

00:01:56.200 --> 00:02:00.470
You must not forget the humiliation of the days as we were driven into dark space!

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:05.810
That we are a chosen people, deserving of that blue world!

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:09.900
Rise, chosen warriors! This is a holy war!

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:40.770
Zaire, Tanzania, Zambia, Namibia...

00:02:40.850 --> 00:02:45.440
Descent on each point has begun. All units expanding landing operations.

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:46.780
Status?

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.280
They appear to be struggling

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:50.450
against a greater Blue counteroffensive than anticipated.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:56.460
Calling 2nd Central Headquarters! The Blue's number is increasing!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:03:00.120
Son of a bitch! Request permission to fall back!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:03.130
Negative! Hold your current position!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:07.140
1st, 2nd and 3rd Divisions are retreating from the front.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:11.800
What are you doing!? Do not fall back! 1st Division, what is the matter!?

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.140
Maintain the front line!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.480
But the Blue have greater battle reserves than anticipated.

00:03:16.550 --> 00:03:19.480
On top of that, with this data being as incomplete as it is...

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.490
There's no way to fight any of the battles...

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:25.150
Can't we send out the new style Armor Shrikes?

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.490
If only we had that new force...

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:32.090
The hatch opening system on the 2nd hanger was damaged in earlier fighting.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:36.760
If it isn't repaired from the outside, it could be impossible for them to attack.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.770
How can this be!?

00:03:38.840 --> 00:03:41.310
To think that the Doubleboards had this much power...

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.610
What the hell is this!?

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.380
Where is the core!?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:55.150
This goes completely against our data, doesn't it!?

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.960
Stay back! Stay back!!

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:11.890
Doubleboard closing in! Range 50!

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.320
That's the new model...?

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:41.930
This feels great! With this, I can...!

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:50.470
It's no good! Where's the data? The precise data on the cores...!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:40.420
He did that on just intuition?

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:42.080
All right, Yuji,

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.990
Tony, keep intercepting the enemy like that!

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:46.890
Depending on how forceful they are,

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:50.090
we'll expand our D information and wait for reinforcements.

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.600
Copy.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:56.100
What's wrong, Tony?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.160
Tony?

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:02.770
Tony! What are you trying to pull!? Get back here!

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:05.780
Yuji, go after Tony! Don't let him go alone!

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.840
Roger.

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:13.450
Marlene and Alicia, extend both wings and give support.

00:06:13.530 --> 00:06:17.460
Rick and Su, you guard the landing craft and scout for enemies in the area.

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.120
Got that!?

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.530
- Roger.
- Right.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:47.260
He did all of this by himself!?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.330
So will I!

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:07.780
Alicia, you're falling behind.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:09.440
I know!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.350
Why is it so hard to move around?

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.440
This is completely different from our drills, you know!

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:16.450
What are you doing!? Do you want to die!?

00:07:16.520 --> 00:07:20.120
Of course I don't want to die, dummy.

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.620
Alicia!

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:26.120
Aah, help me!

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.730
Yuck! What is this!? Aaah!

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.830
Now! Pull it off, Alicia!

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.410
Yuji!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.420
Yuji...

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.790
Dammit! What did I tell you!?

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.490
For real?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.390
All by himself...?

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:39.060
All right, all units, pull back.

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.730
Start mopping up the remaining enemy.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.760
This time, our division's duty will be...

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:09.930
The eradication of the group of Blue Nests that make up the center of G Nest,

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:12.770
the largest on the African continent.

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.700
Since it has withstood direct missile attack,

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:17.760
there can be only one way to destroy G Nest...

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:22.440
Sneak our way inside and destroy it from there.

00:09:22.510 --> 00:09:26.780
We, as the 7th Special Division, will use this old underground road...

00:09:26.850 --> 00:09:31.310
Move from E point to an area underneath G Nest and make our way inside.

00:09:31.390 --> 00:09:35.050
The explosion point is here, in the central area of the nest.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:37.460
The operation commences in thirty minutes!

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:50.070
Yuji...

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:54.310
You're making adjustments again. These Double Edges sure are a lot of trouble.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:56.400
Care for a sip?

00:09:56.480 --> 00:09:58.420
No, there isn't time.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:09:59.750
But...

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:03.080
The Double Edge still has more power than this.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:08.090
I should be able to fight better in this machine. Like Tony does.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:12.100
Tony? But he's weird!

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:18.400
He really is incredible. To think that he could take out a Nest all by himself!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:23.430
What do I have to do to be able to move like that?

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:25.440
Yuji, don't worry about that...

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:28.780
But I can't stand falling behind...

00:10:28.850 --> 00:10:33.040
I've undergone the same drills in those machines...

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.050
Hold on! Yuji, I say!

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:37.550
It's time.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.250
Well, you're no fun.

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:20.400
3... 2... 1... Ignition!

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.940
Entry point secured. Insertion commencing.

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:44.450
How come we have to go the roundabout way of sneaking in like this?

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.490
Don't you understand the mission?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.460
How many Blue do you think they've got lurking around in here?

00:11:49.530 --> 00:11:53.790
I understand that! But still...

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:56.490
Sure, if there were three thousand Double Edges

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:59.470
with superior Sleeper soldiers in them, things would be different.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:01.130
What are you trying to say?

00:12:01.210 --> 00:12:02.470
Nothing much.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.800
What!? If you've got some complaint about me, say it clearly...

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.470
That's enough!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.480
We're in the middle of a mission!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:11.850
I know! Hmph!

00:12:15.220 --> 00:12:21.160
I've discovered a hidden block of Blue life signs 90 meters ahead of us.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:25.490
Altering our progression route to NW-24.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.830
It's a bit of a long way around, but it's under-protected.

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:28.870
Copy.

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:04.130
As dark as this is, we won't be able to tell where the enemy is attacking from.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:05.790
If you're too afraid, go on back by yourself.

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:07.800
I am not afraid!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.130
I am not...

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:10.800
I'm not reading one of the rigs.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:13.140
Seriously? Who?

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:14.470
It's Tony.

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.480
I'm sure he was bringing up the rear.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:19.810
You don't suppose he's been snatched up by the Blue or something?

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.150
Don't be ridiculous.

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:22.810
Tony's present location...

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:25.050
600 meters behind us...

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:28.390
However, if we were to change our route now and join up with him,

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:31.430
it will mean the loss of a great deal of time.

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:34.760
- Never mind that guy.
- We can't very well do that.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.770
- So what should we do?
- Let's split up.

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:41.430
Marlene and I will set the explosives.

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:44.440
Rick, Su and Alicia meet up with Tony.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.100
Seriously? Are you seriously saying that?

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:49.440
Let's go, Marlene.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.500
Okay.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:01.120
Hold on! How can you just decide things to suit yourselves?

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.450
Let's go, Alicia.

00:14:02.530 --> 00:14:04.190
You're kidding, right?

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:15.670
Target acquired. It is stopped 40 meters in front of us.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:19.470
Altering path to point EN-005.

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.510
Copy.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.420
This is the target explosion point...

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:44.090
There're more Blue than I thought.

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:47.100
Yuji, let's wait for Tony and the others to join up.

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:50.440
No, let's go.

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:51.440
Yuji!

00:14:51.510 --> 00:14:53.070
With the battle power of the Double Edge,

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.770
we can handle this number of them.

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:58.440
What are you talking about!? That's impossible! Absolutely!

00:14:58.520 --> 00:15:00.450
That's right. It's too dangerous.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:02.010
Cover me.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.720
What's this?

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.800
What!?

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:26.810
Blue eggs. This must be the spawning ground.

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:28.210
Where's Tony?

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:43.760
What is he doing!?

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.120
Please join up quickly!

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.070
Didn't we tell you not to do it!?

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:41.410
We're driving the same machines...

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:43.750
The same Armor Shrikes...

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.810
We're both the same, Sleepers...

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:57.430
I- I'm out of bullets! No way!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:00.440
Go! Alicia and Marlene! I'll stop these guys!

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.440
Impossible! It's too dangerous!

00:17:02.510 --> 00:17:04.440
That's right! Stop it, already!

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:06.440
- Leave this to me!
- Yuji!

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:09.780
I can as well... I can as well...

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:11.410
I should be the same as Tony!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:24.790
I can do it as well!

00:17:31.470 --> 00:17:33.130
I can do it as well!

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.010
I can do it just as well!

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:21.170
Numerous counts of disobeying orders, and meaningless independent actions...

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.110
and yet there was utterly tremendous success.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.050
Don't missions and following orders matter to the Sleepers

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:30.780
our superiors expect so much of?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:34.720
Would you rather just fight this war yourself? Hmm?

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:37.730
Well?

00:19:37.800 --> 00:19:39.060
What is so funny!?

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:41.720
Wasn't that the whole reason you woke me up?

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:43.730
Why, you...!

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.070
If you don't like it, do as you like.

00:19:46.140 --> 00:19:48.500
If you guys can win on your own, that is...

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:55.450
You amateur!

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:03.450
Yuji...

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:17.090
Are you bothered about this afternoon?

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:19.100
I didn't want to fall behind.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:25.440
Tony? I understand how you feel, but there's no point in rushing yourself.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.770
But we're alike, Sleepers...

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:34.380
We use the same machines. And yet, he's completely different from me.

00:20:34.450 --> 00:20:37.390
That's not so.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:41.720
You've gotten strong, Yuji.

00:20:41.790 --> 00:20:43.260
Marlene...

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:53.060
But I've got to become stronger!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:57.130
Stronger, and take back the Earth from the clutches of the Blue!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:00.700
Absolutely!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:39.880
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:46.010
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:55.160
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.280 --> 00:22:01.330
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:07.750
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:14.940
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:20.100
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:26.160
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.460 --> 00:22:32.440
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:39.920
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:46.780
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:56.690
Impossible! How can there be children in a place like this!?

00:22:58.230 --> 00:23:00.170
Yuji, they're more important than the Blue now...

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:05.500
Shut up! Marlene, we're on a mission right now! Move!

00:23:05.570 --> 00:23:07.840
Stop! Stop, Yuji!

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:09.840
Don't get in my way!

00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.000
Yuji!
